    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n1688" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄελπ-τος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>unhoped for, unexpected,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				h.Cer.
				219
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				96.57
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				B.
				3.29
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξ ἀέλπτου</span>
			<i>beyond hope, unexpectedly</i>, in good sense, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.111
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξ ἀέλπτων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Aj.</u>
					715
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); in bad sense, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Supp.</u>
				357
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				987
			</span></i> (prob. l.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πῆμ᾽ ἄ., ἄ.
			κακόν</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Pers.</u>
				265
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				1006
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἴπερ ὄψομαι τὰν ἄ. ἁμέραν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Supp.</u>
					784
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄ&lt;&gt;λπτα γὰρ λέγεις</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Hel.</u>
				585
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>beyond hope, despaired of</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Archil.
				74
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Art.</u>
				42
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Act.
			, <i>hopeless, desperate,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				h.Ap.
				91
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Supp.</u>
				907
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τως</span>
			<i>beyond all hope</i>, in good sense, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Pers.</u>
				261
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>El.</u>
				1263
			</span></i>: neut. pl. as Adv., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. φανείς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Ph.</u>
					311
				</span></i>
			. [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾱ</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hes.
			</span></i> l.c.]</div>
